   deployed build they're on; collapsed into a corner and kept unobtrusive so
   it never covers gameplay. During the pre-match screen the badge is always
   visible and (for Devvit builds) stacks the game version above the Devvit
   experience version. During gameplay it is hidden by default — the version
   is surfaced instead in the lower-right quickInfo tooltip on round-marker
   hover (see gameFormatter in ui/interface.ts). */
